@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. New Lightweight Pre-Approval Endpoint (For External App Integration)
# Accepts document file, requested loan, tenure, interest rate.
# Returns ONLY decision status, approved amount, pre-approved potential offer,
# monthly income, monthly disposable income / EMI capacity, customer name & account number.
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/loan/pre-approval
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="sample_bank_statement.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../sample_bank_statement.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="RequestedLoan"

500000
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Tenure"

36
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="InterestRate"

10.5
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 2. Full Application Process Endpoint (Original Existing Endpoint - Unmodified)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/loan/process
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="sample_bank_statement.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../sample_bank_statement.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="RequestedLoanAmount"

500000
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TenureMonths"

36
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="AnnualInterestRate"

10.5
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
